Rotation.RotationNotes:
Specific Function:
     
- Focus target to use Beacon of Light + Sacred Shield (Best on Tank);

Notes:
- DO NOT TARGET A FRIENDLY PLAYER;

Holy Paladin PvP rotation for battlegrounds. Talent build: 51/5/15 (Holy/Prot/Ret) or similar with Beacon of Light, Sacred Shield, Aura Mastery, Divine Illumination, Improved Concentration Aura, Improved Hammer of Justice, Improved Blessing of Wisdom.

STRATEGY: Beacon YOURSELF (not tank -- PvP has no tank focus). Every Holy Light on an ally then doubles onto you. Sacred Shield on self for extra absorb + reduced Flash of Light pushback. Heal Engine picks the ally target (do NOT target friendlies manually).

DEFENSIVE / SELF-PRESERVATION (auto, in-combat only):
- PvP:Beacon of Light (Self): keeps BoL up on you (refresh under 15s remaining);
- PvP:Sacred Shield (Self): keeps SS absorb up on you (refresh under 8s remaining);
- All:Divine Shield: bubble at HP &lt; 20% (respects Forbearance 25771);
- All:Divine Protection: 50% dmg reduction at HP &lt; 30%;
- All:Hand of Freedom (Player): auto self-cast on snare/root debuff table;
- H:Cleanse (Self) / H:Cleanse: clears Magic/Poison/Disease on self and ally;
- PvP:Aura Mastery: fires on silence/interrupt debuff on self (Silence, Kick, Counterspell, etc.);
- PvP:Lay on Hands (Self): HP &lt; 15% self-panic (respects Forbearance);
- H:Hand of Sacrifice: on ally when your HP &gt; 60% (redirects 30% dmg to you);
- PvP:Divine Plea (PvP): mana &lt; 40% AND HP &gt; 70% (safe window -- Divine Plea reduces healing 50%);
- H:Avenging Wrath: throughput cooldown chained with Divine Illumination.

FOCUS PRESSURE (set /focus on enemy healer or kill target):
- PvP:Hammer of Justice (Focus): 6s stun on focus while it casts an interruptible spell, or on an enemy healer at HP &lt; 90% (setup peel).

TRINKETS: Use:Trinkets/Hands (PvP) fires gloves tinker + on-use trinkets in combat. PvP medallions (18854/18855/42364/42365/42126/61048) fire only when actually CCed.

KNOWN LIMITATIONS (from base pala profile, not fixed here):
- Offensive racials (Blood Fury / Berserking / Stoneform / Gift of the Naaru) in -- All:Racial -- are IsBoss-gated -- won&apos;t fire in BGs. Undead WotF DOES fire (no gate).
- -- All:Potions -- is IsBoss-gated (no auto potion). Bind mana/healthstone potions to keys.
- -- Offensive Spells (H) -- is intentionally NOT included in this rotation -- it short-circuits on non-boss targets.

MANUAL:
- Left Ctrl pauses rotation (via Hotkeys);
- do NOT target a friendly player -- Heal Engine picks heal targets;
- keep the enemy healer or focus-swap target as /focus for Hammer of Justice kicks.

TEST MODE (dummy testing):
- Enable:  /run PQR_TestMode = true
- Disable: /run PQR_TestMode = nil
- When ON, Hammer of Justice (Focus) bypasses UnitIsPlayer so it fires on training dummies. Defensive spells still need real damage / low HP / low mana to trigger.
